<main class="about">
  <a class="back" href="/">‹ Home</a>
  <h1>What is this?</h1>
  <p>
    Buzz Buzz is a word game. Each puzzle gives you seven letters, and you
    make as many words from them as you can.
  </p>

  <h2>How to play</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Words must be at least 4 letters long.</li>
    <li>Every word must use the center letter.</li>
    <li>Letters can be used more than once.</li>
    <li>4-letter words are worth 1 point. Longer words are worth 1 point per letter.</li>
    <li>A <strong>pangram</strong> uses all 7 letters, and earns 7 bonus points.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Ways to play</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Daily:</strong> a new puzzle every day. Climb the ranks to Genius.</li>
    <li><strong>Puzzles:</strong> find the hidden pangram to unlock the next puzzle.</li>
    <li><strong>Pangramble:</strong> bet Buzz bucks and race the clock to find the pangram.</li>
  </ul>

  <p class="credits">
    Based on <a href="https://github.com/Gyanreyer/open-spelling-bee">Open Spelling Bee</a>
    by Ryan Geyer, MIT license.
  </p>
</main>

